{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What\u2019s waiting for you in the demo?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meet Mervin </strong>\u2014 a nice guy forced by his mother to finally grow up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Absurd missions</strong> \u2013 Master (or completely fail at) the basics of adulthood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Questionable friendships</strong> \u2013 Connect with the wonderfully unhinged world of online weirdos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dark humor</strong> \u2013 Bizarre dialogues and unexpected WTF moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mini-games</strong> \u2013 Hack systems, unwind with puzzles, look after a fish, and much more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Earn some money \u2014 </strong>Take part in a virtual live mass to gather donations, dig cryptocurrencies, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you shake off your laziness, conquer life, and finally stop being... yourself? Buckle up\u2014it\u2019ll be one hell of a midlife crisis!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3525010?t=1740416899","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3525010?t=1740416899","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525010/80537c69caabcf4912133a7118226e0eb151f905/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740416899","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525010/80537c69caabcf4912133a7118226e0eb151f905/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740416899","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What\u2019s waiting for you in the demo?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meet Mervin </strong>\u2014 a nice guy force